treating this as what is it

00:04:19.579 --> 00:04:21.815
that's actually going to
be useful in somebody's life.

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:26.090
- Absolutely.
That's great. Mike,

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.410
I see you had your
hand raised too.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.960
