man on markdown files.

00:28:59.800 --> 00:29:02.890
Yes, definitely documentation
to be able to onboard

00:29:03.910 --> 00:29:05.240
those team members.

00:29:05.240 --> 00:29:09.745
But what I found more important
is being onboarded even to the culture

00:29:12.520 --> 00:29:13.746
of the organization.

00:29:15.210 --> 00:29:16.660
In my current role--

00:29:16.660 --> 00:29:17.160
well,

00:29:17.830 --> 00:29:19.465
when I joined my current

00:29:21.310 --> 00:29:24.490
