00:29:37.580 --> 00:29:38.080
and

00:29:39.900 --> 00:29:42.740
the interviewer just
went, haha, yeah,

00:29:42.740 --> 00:29:44.280
and then he just kept on going.

00:29:44.280 --> 00:29:47.720
