here. You could read.

00:30:20.300 --> 00:30:22.880
You can move forward to
it. If there's a hiccup,

00:30:22.880 --> 00:30:24.810
the mentor will be able
to support you there.

00:30:24.810 --> 00:30:27.770
So I think that's my
big take on onboarding,

00:30:27.770 --> 00:30:28.610
definitely a mentor.

00:30:29.660 --> 00:30:31.550
- Yeah, absolutely.

