00:31:16.160 --> 00:31:18.170
here's a slide deck but also

00:31:18.830 --> 00:31:21.800
keep it handy because there's a
lot of little things that make

00:31:21.800 --> 00:31:22.920
your life a lot easier.

00:31:22.920 --> 00:31:25.280
So after they've gone through
where the data comes from and

00:31:25.280 --> 00:31:26.090
all that other stuff,

00:31:26.090 --> 00:31:28.265
we just do this wrap
up to connect the dots,

00:31:28.850 --> 00:31:30.530
and it seems to be
helpful for folks.

00:31:32.750 --> 00:31:33.515
- Yeah. Thank you.

