understanding of the positions

00:32:11.840 --> 00:32:12.950
that you're probably helping,

00:32:12.950 --> 00:32:14.870
or the departments that
you're probably helping with

00:32:16.550 --> 00:32:19.860
their data, is just getting
to know what are they doing,

00:32:19.860 --> 00:32:21.980
what are the things that
are important to them.

00:32:22.910 --> 00:32:25.460
