to some extent, but now we have

00:41:36.450 --> 00:41:39.180
200 something people who come
together at least once a month

00:41:39.180 --> 00:41:40.470
plus team channels and stuff,

00:41:40.470 --> 00:41:43.620
and we're all helping
each other and deploying packages

00:41:43.620 --> 00:41:45.700
that we can all share
and things like that.

00:41:45.700 --> 00:41:48.720
